{"3459990": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Cosmic Composer", "steam_appid": 3459990, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Build Stars</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3459990/extras/17181fc0c715c1e03b962f22e70bf5a2.poster.avif?t=1787827657\" width=960 height=540 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3459990/extras/17181fc0c715c1e03b962f22e70bf5a2.webm?t=1787827657\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3459990/extras/17181fc0c715c1e03b962f22e70bf5a2.mp4?t=1787827657\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Create Planets</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3459990/extras/d414059e803066a7a80d8cc7b0935698.poster.avif?t=1787827657\" width=960 height=540 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3459990/extras/d414059e803066a7a80d8cc7b0935698.webm?t=1787827657\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3459990/extras/d414059e803066a7a80d8cc7b0935698.mp4?t=1787827657\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Explode stars as a supernova</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3459990/extras/a5e55b1d36773fa8a91c5b3cd0b0d4f4.poster.avif?t=1787827657\" width=960 height=540 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3459990/extras/a5e55b1d36773fa8a91c5b3cd0b0d4f4.webm?t=1787827657\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3459990/extras/a5e55b1d36773fa8a91c5b3cd0b0d4f4.mp4?t=1787827657\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >CREATE AND MODIFY  </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build stars, planets and nebulae, then modify and combine them into new cosmic objects all the way to galaxies and black holes.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cosmic objects have their own special abilities that cost cosmic energy to use.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Planets can collide and form a new kind of planet in the process.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Stars can use abilities like stellar winds, solar flares and supernovae. These can modify nearby cosmic objects in different ways, evolve them to something new or destroy them.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Using ability can trigger a chain reaction of multiple events so be careful not to destroy everything in a single supernova explosion... unless that's what you want.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >COMPLETE QUESTS  </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Quests are build based or event based.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build quest requires a set of cosmic objects to be in the quest area. For example a star and three different planets needs to be in the quest area to be completed.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Event quests require something to happen in the quest area for example a supernova explosion or planetary collision.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When all quests are completed the level is completed.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >RESOURCE MANAGEMENT  </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cosmic Energy is used as a resource for every action and you have a limited amount of it.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Balancing energy usage is important for completing the level.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Will you safely complete needed quests or try to reach for a higher score?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3459990/extras/9702a691e9617ff5124cb0d74a75cdf8.avif?t=1787827657\" width=400 height=400 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Build Stars</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3459990/extras/17181fc0c715c1e03b962f22e70bf5a2.poster.avif?t=1787827657\" width=960 height=540 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3459990/extras/17181fc0c715c1e03b962f22e70bf5a2.webm?t=1787827657\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3459990/extras/17181fc0c715c1e03b962f22e70bf5a2.mp4?t=1787827657\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Create Planets</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3459990/extras/d414059e803066a7a80d8cc7b0935698.poster.avif?t=1787827657\" width=960 height=540 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3459990/extras/d414059e803066a7a80d8cc7b0935698.webm?t=1787827657\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3459990/extras/d414059e803066a7a80d8cc7b0935698.mp4?t=1787827657\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Explode stars as a supernova</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3459990/extras/a5e55b1d36773fa8a91c5b3cd0b0d4f4.poster.avif?t=1787827657\" width=960 height=540 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3459990/extras/a5e55b1d36773fa8a91c5b3cd0b0d4f4.webm?t=1787827657\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3459990/extras/a5e55b1d36773fa8a91c5b3cd0b0d4f4.mp4?t=1787827657\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >CREATE AND MODIFY  </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build stars, planets and nebulae, then modify and combine them into new cosmic objects all the way to galaxies and black holes.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cosmic objects have their own special abilities that cost cosmic energy to use.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Planets can collide and form a new kind of planet in the process.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Stars can use abilities like stellar winds, solar flares and supernovae. These can modify nearby cosmic objects in different ways, evolve them to something new or destroy them.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Using ability can trigger a chain reaction of multiple events so be careful not to destroy everything in a single supernova explosion... unless that's what you want.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >COMPLETE QUESTS  </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Quests are build based or event based.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build quest requires a set of cosmic objects to be in the quest area. For example a star and three different planets needs to be in the quest area to be completed.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Event quests require something to happen in the quest area for example a supernova explosion or planetary collision.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When all quests are completed the level is completed.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >RESOURCE MANAGEMENT  </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cosmic Energy is used as a resource for every action and you have a limited amount of it.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Balancing energy usage is important for completing the level.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Will you safely complete needed quests or try to reach for a higher score?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3459990/extras/9702a691e9617ff5124cb0d74a75cdf8.avif?t=1787827657\" width=400 height=400 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "short_description": "Casual puzzle game on a cosmic scale. Build stars, planets and other cosmic objects. Evolve your cosmos using abilities of the stars from stellar winds to supernova.", "supported_languages": "English, French, German, Simplified Chinese, Spanish - Spain", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3459990/1ff59e154cbcdb9f3c14db233421d5561ee659fc/header.jpg?t=1787827657", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3459990/3d168491897df36b2669dbe2db2206305521325a/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1787827657", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3459990/3d168491897df36b2669dbe2db2206305521325a/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1787827657", "website": null, "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10</li></ul>", "recommended": "<strong>Re